{"id":15708670624118,"title":"Reachy Mini Wireless","handle":"reachy-mini-wireless-version","description":"\u003ch2\u003eExpressive, Autonomous, and Ready to Go\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Suggested for non-developers)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReachy Mini Wireless is a fully standalone AI robot that thinks, moves, and interacts on its own, no external computer required. With on-board Raspberry Pi CM4 processing, built-in Wi-Fi, and a rich sensor suite, it's the most capable desktop robot for AI experimentation, education, and creative projects.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9 servo motors for fluid, expressive movement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6-DOF head motion (roll, pitch, yaw, x, y, z)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e±160° body rotation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 animated antennas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWide-angle camera\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4-microphone array\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5W speaker\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRaspberry Pi CM4 on-board (16GB storage)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-in IMU (accelerometer)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWi-Fi and USB connectivity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery powered + power supply included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandalone operation, no PC needed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eShips as a DIY Kit\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEverything you need to build your Reachy Mini is included across 3 boxes: structure, motors, electronics, camera, microphones, speaker, screws, and accessories. No 3D printer or soldering required. Tools and a detailed assembly guide are included.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eShipping \u0026amp; Import Duties\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLead time: up to 90 days after purchase (many orders ship sooner). Import duties are calculated and added at checkout based on your destination country.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u00